## Statement

Compute $(1+i)^{20}$.

## Hint

Compute $(1+i)^2$ first.

## Solution

We have $(1+i)^2=1+2i+i^2=2i$. Therefore
$$(1+i)^{20}=\left((1+i)^2\right)^{10}=(2i)^{10}=2^{10}\,i^{10}=1024\cdot(i^2)^5=1024\cdot(-1)^5=-1024.$$
